ARTICLE I — DECLARATION OF SOVEREIGN ORIGIN

This instrument governs the Work identified on the cover page.

"The Work" means: all source code, compiled artifacts, documentation,
architecture definitions, algorithmic structures, design abstractions,
encoded intelligence patterns, commentary, specifications, and all other
expressions of creative or technical authorship contained in or derived
from the associated software, documentation, or repository.

The Work is the sovereign intellectual property of ItsNotAILABS ("the
Sovereign"). No portion of this License has been adapted, derived, or
reproduced from any third-party license framework. This instrument is an
original creation of the Sovereign and stands entirely on its own authority.

